  "url": "https://new.web.cafe/tutorial/detail/eppwa23at3",
  "title": "【2024.2.2.20案例 拆解】https://askaichat.app/",
  "author": "哥飞",
  "authorAvatar": "https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/eppwa23at3_avatar.jpg",
  "tags": [
    "哥飞案例拆解"
  ],
  "content": "<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/eppwa23at3_img1.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><a href=\"https://askaichat.app/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://askaichat.app/</a> 月访问量从12月的18万增长到1月的110万。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/eppwa23at3_img2.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/eppwa23at3_img3.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>这就有意思了，可以去分析下这个产品，到底怎么赚钱，为什么会去投放广告，是否可以回本。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/eppwa23at3_img4.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>这个站1月有5万个访问跳转到了checkout.stripe.com，也就是有差不多5万个订单被创建了。 不过不清楚支付成功比例。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/eppwa23at3_img5.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>注册后下一步立马就是支付，主推一年29.9美元的套餐。\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/eppwa23at3_img5.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>大部分人会选择年付，假设有10%的支付成功比例，那么1月就有5000个订单，月收入 15万美元。</div>\n<div>这里10%是我瞎猜的，可能会更高。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/eppwa23at3_img6.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>海外知识付费 <a href=\"https://educate.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://educate.io/</a> ，单价 1499美元，1月份点击到 stripe 的流量有 4.4万。 即使按照1%的付费成功比例，也有65万美元收入。</div>\n<div>主要流量来自于社交平台，更具体来说，是来自于 Youtube 。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/eppwa23at3_img7.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>有传销的感觉了。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/eppwa23at3_img8.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>",
